e/4413695/swarm-zapper-3d\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"action_btn related_games_btn\" data-label=\"related_btn\"><svg height=\"18\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" aria-hidden stroke-linejoin=\"round\" version=\"1.1\" stroke-width=\"2\" class=\"svgicon icon_map\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" role=\"img\" width=\"18\"><polygon points=\"1 6 1 22 8 18 16 22 23 18 23 2 16 6 8 2 1 6\"></polygon><line x1=\"8\" y1=\"2\" x2=\"8\" y2=\"18\"></line><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"6\" x2=\"16\" y2=\"22\"></line></svg> <span class=\"full_label\">Related games</span><span class=\"mobile_label\">Related</span></a></li></ul><script type=\"text/javascript\">new I.GameUserTools('#user_tools')</script><div id=\"wrapper\" class=\"main wrapper game_page_wrapper\"><div id=\"inner_column\" class=\"inner_column size_large family_lato\"><div class=\"header\" id=\"header\"><h1 itemprop=\"name\" class=\"game_title\">SWARM ZAPPER 3D</h1></div><div id=\"view_html_game_7833862\" class=\"view_html_game_page view_game_page page_widget base_widget ready\"><div id=\"html_embed_1605804\" class=\"html_embed_widget base_widget embed_wrapper\"><div data-width=\"600\" data-height=\"600\" class=\"game_frame game_pending\" style=\"width: 600px; height: 600px\"><button class=\"fullscreen_btn\" title=\"Enter fullscreen\"><img src=\"https://itch.io/static/images/enlarge.svg?1788406861\"/></button><div class=\"iframe_placeholder\" data-iframe=\"&lt;iframe allowtransparency=&quot;true&quot; webkitallowfullscreen=&quot;true&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;true&quot; scrolling=&quot;no&quot; allow=&quot;autoplay; fullscreen *; geolocation; microphone; camera; midi; monetization; xr-spatial-tracking; gamepad; gyroscope; accelerometer; xr; cross-origin-isolated; web-share&quot; id=&quot;game_drop&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; mozallowfullscreen=&quot;true&quot; msallowfullscreen=&quot;true&quot; src=&quot;https://html-classic.itch.zone/html/16916694/index.html?v=1783164757&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;\"><button class=\"button load_iframe_btn\"><svg height=\"24\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" aria-hidden stroke-linejoin=\"round\" version=\"1.1\" stroke-width=\"2\" class=\"svgicon icon_play\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" role=\"img\" width=\"24\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><polygon points=\"10 8 16 12 10 16 10 8\"></polygon></svg> Run game</button></div></div></div><div class=\"donate\"><a href=\"https://haruka-apps-games.itch.io/swarm-zapper-3d/donate\" class=\"button donate_btn\" data-donate=\"true\">Support This Game</a></div><div class=\"columns\"><div class=\"left_col column\"><div class=\"formatted_description user_formatted\"><p><strong>\u26a1 ABOUT THE GAME \u26a1</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>SWARM ZAPPER 3D</strong>&nbsp;is a fast-paced, pseudo-3D arcade defense game where you play as an omnipresent force wiping out endless waves of alien ants. <br>Summon destructive lightning strikes from the sky to shatter their terrain, block their paths, and vaporize the swarm before they completely take over!</p>\r\n<p>As the battlefield takes damage, it enters <strong>Phase 2 (Cube Rain)</strong>. The original pyramid is destroyed, and new blocks will continuously rain from the sky, building highly unpredictable, chaotic towers with shifting color stratas. The swarm will panic, scurry faster, and multiply, resulting in an intense test of your reflexes and zapping precision!</p>\r\n<p><strong>&nbsp;\ud83c\udfae CONTROLS \ud83c\udfae</strong></p>\r\n<p>- <strong>[ SPACE ]</strong>: Strike Lightning (Aim is randomized: targets cubes, ants, or the ground!)<br>- <strong>[ S ]</strong>: Toggle Sound ON/OFF<br>- <strong>[ Q ]</strong>: Quit Game</p>\r\n<p><strong>&nbsp;\ud83c\udf1f FEATURES \ud83c\udf1f</strong></p>\r\n<p>- <strong>Voxel-style Isometric 3D Rendering:</strong>&nbsp;Fully destructible terrain rendered cleanly in pure code.</p>\r\n<p>- <strong>Dynamic Swarm AI:</strong>&nbsp;Ants use 3D pathfinding to climb blocks, detour around craters, and panic erratically during Phase 2.</p>\r\n<p>- <strong>Phase Transition:</strong>&nbsp;After destroying the initial pyramid, blocks dynamically rain from the sky, stacking in random configurations with glowing colors that change dynamically based on time survived.</p>\r\n<p>- <strong>Procedural Visuals &amp; Sound:</strong>&nbsp;Heavy screen flares, particle explosions, responsive UI elements, and procedural retro sound effects.</p>\r\n<p><strong>&nbsp;\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f CREDITS \ud83d\udee0\ufe0f</strong></p>\r\n<p>- <strong>Created by:</strong>&nbsp;haruka_apps<br>- <strong>Engine:</strong>&nbsp;Built with Python &amp; [Pyxel](https://github.com/kitao/pyxel)<br>- <strong>Assisted by:</strong>&nbsp;Antigravity</p></div><div class=\"more_information_toggle\"><div class=\"toggle_row\"><a class=\"toggle_info_btn\" href=\"javascript:void(0)\">More information<svg height=\"6\" class=\"svgicon icon_down_tick\" role=\"img\" viewBox=\"0 0 37 20\" version=\"1.1\" aria-hidden width=\"12\"><path d=\"m2.0858 0c-1.1535 0-2.0858 0.86469-2.0858 1.9331 0 0.5139 0.21354 1.0183 0.38704 1.1881l18.113 16.879 18.112-16.879c0.174-0.1696 0.388-0.674 0.388-1.1879 0-1.0684-0.932-1.9331-2.086-1.9331-0.577 0-1.111 0.23008-1.49 0.57992l-14.924 13.894-14.925-13.893c-0.3777-0.34998-0.9134-0.581-1.4902-0.581z\"/></svg></a></div><div class=\"info_panel_wrapper\"><div id=\"game_info_panel_7547756\" class=\"game_info_panel_widget base_widget\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Updated</td><td><abbr title=\"21 August 2026 @ 09:47 UTC\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon icon-stopwatch\"></span> 12 days ago</abbr></td></tr><tr><td>Status</td><td><a href=\"https://itch.io/games/released\">Released</a></td></tr><tr><td>Platforms</td><td><a href=\"https://itch.io/games/html5\">HTML5</a></td></tr><tr><td>Author</td><td><a href=\"https://haruka-apps-games.itch.io\">haruka_apps</a></td></tr><tr><td>Genre</td><td><a href=\"https://itch.io/games/genre-action\">Action</a></td></tr><tr><td>Tags</td>